# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# API Server - .htaccess Configuration & Policy
# Evaluated natively by api::htaccess_engine and accessible in Lua scripts
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteEngine On

# ── Security Response Headers ───────────────────────────────────────────────
Header set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
Header set X-Frame-Options "DENY"
Header set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"

# ── IP Access Control ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Order allow,deny
Allow from all

# ── Custom Error Documents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
ErrorDocument 403 {"error":"Forbidden by .htaccess security policy","status":403}
ErrorDocument 404 {"error":"Resource not found","status":404}
ErrorDocument 410 {"error":"Resource is permanently gone","status":410}

# ── URL Rewriting & Redirection Rules ───────────────────────────────────────
# Example: Redirect legacy endpoints
# Redirect 301 /api/v0/health /api/health
# RewriteRule ^/v1/(.*)$ /api/$1 [L]
